// Resolves a ball-vs-brick collision: determines which face(s) were hit from
// the axis of smallest penetration, flips the matching velocity components
// (exactly once), and pushes the ball back outside the brick so it doesn't
// stay overlapped on the next frame (sticky bounce). Returns nothing.
